## ObjectType: Flexibility Offer

Local operational object; source concept reference does not assert OWL equivalence.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| offer_id | Offer id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | offer_id |
| event_id | Event id | string | Explicit foreign-key association; blank creates no edge. | event_id |
| device_id | Device id | string | Explicit foreign-key association; blank creates no edge. | device_id |
| offered_kw | Offered kw | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | offered_kw |
| cost_cny_kwh | Cost cny kwh | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | cost_cny_kwh |
| status | Status | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | status |
| status_code | Status code | string | Stable English code; paired display field is localized. | status_code |
| valid_from | Valid from | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | valid_from |
| valid_to | Valid to | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | valid_to |
| revision | Revision | integer | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | revision |
| known_date | Known date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | known_date |

